<title>USA: Addvantage Media listed on SmallCap Market.</title>
<headline>Addvantage Media listed on SmallCap Market.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Addvantage Media Group Inc said Friday its publicly-held securities, which have been traded on the OTC Bulletin Board, have been approved for listing on the NASDAQ SmallCap Market beginning today.</p>
<p>The company's stock will begin under the symbol.</p>
<p>Addvantage Media is a marketing company with a primary focus on in-store, point-of-sale consumer advertising.</p>
